#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Storage Engine v6 — Local Reconstruction Codes (LRC)
#  File: storage_engine_v6_lrc.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS Storage Engine v6:
#      • Local Reconstruction Codes (LRC)
#      • local parity groups
#      • global parity
#      • fast local repair
#      • distributed sharding
#      • cluster-aware healing
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Local Parity Groups](ca://s?q=Explain_LRC_Local_Parity_Groups)
#    - [Global Parity](ca://s?q=Explain_LRC_Global_Parity)
#    - [Local Repair](ca://s?q=Explain_LRC_Local_Repair)
#    - [Distributed Sharding](ca://s?q=Explain_LRC_Distributed_Shards)
#    - [Cluster Healing](ca://s?q=Explain_LRC_Cluster_Healing)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_volume(name, size_mb, nodes)
#         Creates LRC(K,G,M) volume.
#
#    - write(volume_id, data)
#         Encodes into groups, local parity, global parity, distributes shards.
#
#    - read(volume_id, shard_ids)
#         Reads shards and repairs missing ones using local or global parity.
#
#    - snapshot(volume_id)
#         Creates distributed snapshot.
#
#    - restore(snapshot_id)
#         Restores shard map from snapshot.
#
#    - engine_snapshot()
#         Returns engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  SHARD MAP FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "LRCVOL-XXXX": {
#          "SHR-A": "NODE-1",
#          "SHR-B": "NODE-2",
#          "SHR-C": "NODE-3",
#          ...
#      }
#    }
#
